<title>SWEDEN: FORECAST-Handelsbanken forecasts on Sweden economy.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Handelsbanken forecasts on Sweden economy.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are Swedish bank Handelsbanken's forecasts for the Swedish economy:</p>
<p>(percent change unless stated)</p>
<p>					 1996	1997     1998</p>
<p> Consumer prices		    0.8	 1.2	2.2</p>
<p> Industrial production	    2.7	 7.0	6.5</p>
<p> Open unemployment of workforce 8.0	 7.8	7.3</p>
<p> Total unemployment		13.0	13.0     12.3</p>
<p> PSBR, billions of crowns	  22	  20	 22</p>
<p> Budget deficit, pct of GDP     2.5	 1.6	0.3</p>
<p> State debt pct of GDP	     77	  74	 72</p>
<p> Trade balance, billions of SKR 133	 135	155</p>
<p> Current Account, billions	 50	  50	 70</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
</text>
